# Not a parity scenario: the three Left spellings at a choice where xfx and
# fx v0.0.16 differ the other way (xfx moves, fx does not), kept out of
# p5-question-word-left so that pair can be GREEN. Each from page 4, reached
# as there; ESC ESC [ D last, because xfx reads it as Escape and Left, and
# the Escape cancels the batch.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-input-question20-turns.json
wait 4
type ask twenty
key Enter
wait 3
key Tab Tab Tab
wait 0.4
snap p4
key S-Left
wait 0.4
snap shift-left
key Left Left Left Left
key Tab Tab Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 02
wait 0.4
snap ctrl-b
key Left Left Left Left
key Tab Tab Tab
wait 0.4
key -H 1b 1b 5b 44
wait 0.6
snap esc-esc-left
